   "worked_solution": [
      {
         "step": 1,
         "text": "The y-coordinate is the known value plus the accumulated change: \\( y(2) = y(1) + \\int_{1}^{2} \\left(4 \\sqrt{t} e^{- \\frac{t}{2}}\\right)\\,dt \\).",
         "point_type_id": "BC-PT-99033",
         "rule_named": "position from an initial condition"
      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "With a calculator the integral is about 2.295.",
